{"id":"06716925478ef7cf72c523766a7b0a4dff30f979","axis":"silent","repo":"apache/shiro","sha":"06716925478ef7cf72c523766a7b0a4dff30f979","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"samples/spring-boot-web/README.md","lines":["@@ -12,3 +12,16 @@ mvn spring-boot:run"," ```"," "," Browse to `http://localhost:8080/`","+","+Path Matching","+-------------","+","+The starter's environment post-processor requests Ant path matching from Spring MVC when Boot still supports it.","+If MVC instead uses Spring's native `PathPatternParser` (for example, when the Ant setting is no longer supported), the starter","+uses Spring's parsed patterns for both Shiro filter-chain selection and path-aware filters.","+Shiro chain definitions then use Spring path-pattern syntax, and invalid patterns fail during startup.","+Matching remains case-insensitive by default, independently of MVC's parser setting, to preserve protection for","+static resources on case-insensitive filesystems. Set `shiro.caseInsensitive=false` to explicitly opt into","+case-sensitive matching. Shiro also retains its trailing-slash retry: `/admin` and `/admin/` select the same","+restriction, even if MVC distinguishes those paths. Filter-chain definitions retain Shiro's first-match ordering","+and deny-by-default fallback."],"additions":13,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"support/spring-boot/spring-boot-starter/src/main/java/org/apache/shiro/spring/config/web/autoconfigure/ShiroEnvironmentPostProcessor.java","lines":["@@ -18,21 +18,31 @@","  */"," package org.apache.shiro.spring.config.web.autoconfigure;"," ","+import org.jspecify.annotations.NonNull;"," import org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor;"," import org.springframework.boot.SpringApplication;","+import org.springframework.boot.webmvc.autoconfigure.WebMvcProperties.MatchingStrategy;"," import org.springframework.core.PriorityOrdered;"," import org.springframework.core.env.ConfigurableEnvironment;"," import org.springframework.core.env.MapPropertySource;"," 